{
  "@context": "context.jsonld",
  "@id": "files",
  "@type": "App",
  "position": 3,
  "id": "files",
  "family": "office",
  "icon": "📁",
  "name": "Files",
  "surface": "window",
  "url": "../../magpie/edot/files/files.html",
  "desc": "Pod explorer",
  "capabilities": [
    "storage"
  ],
  "silent": true,
  "notes": [
    "MIGRATED (July 2026). Files stored nothing itself — its escape hatch was bought for OPFS, which needs an origin to hang a storage bucket on and so is refused outright in a sandboxed frame. It now probes the device mount and falls back to BrokeredResourceSource: the same list/read/write/remove/stat/mkdir interface over the shell's store.",
    "files.html, not the directory: there is no index.html here, so the bare path served a directory listing locally and would 404 on GitHub Pages. The app had never actually loaded inside the shell."
  ]
}
